invariant: INV-41
file: src/rsa_mont_division.h
catches: rsa_equiv_test_blocks
reason: times_word_mod_blocks adds the estimate times R - m and does not
  take the estimate off the word above the k, so that word is the
  estimate too large and the step adds the modulus back twice to a
  remainder that needed none. bin/rsa_equiv_test_blocks compiles the
  step in blocks under any compiler and compares rsa_vp1 with the 32-bit
  arm.

--- old
    uint64_t above = moved + carry - estimate;
--- new
    uint64_t above = moved + carry;
